    "text": "<p>At resonance, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Voltage across the series <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi></math> combination,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>",
